            "type": "game",
            "name": "The Good Life",
            "steam_appid": 293340,
            "required_age": "10",
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Like so many, Derek Hales is fed up and is dreaming about ditching the nine-to-five lifestyle. When he learns that his late uncle made him the sole heir of Carpe Diem Boats, a boating company on the tropical complex of the Jo Jo islands, he does not hesitate for a second. A new life awaits! After a long voyage, he and his striking girlfriend Michelle Joyce finally arrive at their destination, enjoying the beautiful sunrise, with a Boating Company of their own. Compared to the dull office life, this new life looks much better. Finally but suddenly, life is good!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>With an array of luxury vessels at your disposal, take on various missions across ultra-realistic tropical waters, in order to make your fortune. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Experience vast, beautiful tropical locations, with more than 50 harbors and dozens of diverse places to explore. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Become an adept skipper and progress across 6 different ship types. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Realistic weather conditions and 24hr day/night cycle. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Seek treasures in the deep, rescue people from drowning, avoid pirate attacks and become rich and famous! <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Use your earnings to build your commercial empire, buy and sell properties in this tropical paradise, progress from sun beds, beach houses and bungalows, to restaurants, villas and even hotels. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Play against 9 other NPC Skippers who compete for business against you, become the best skipper, earn more money and become the ultimate tycoon of the JoJo Islands!</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Like so many, Derek Hales is fed up and is dreaming about ditching the nine-to-five lifestyle. When he learns that his late uncle made him the sole heir of Carpe Diem Boats, a boating company on the tropical complex of the Jo Jo islands, he does not hesitate for a second. A new life awaits! After a long voyage, he and his striking girlfriend Michelle Joyce finally arrive at their destination, enjoying the beautiful sunrise, with a Boating Company of their own. Compared to the dull office life, this new life looks much better. Finally but suddenly, life is good!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>With an array of luxury vessels at your disposal, take on various missions across ultra-realistic tropical waters, in order to make your fortune. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Experience vast, beautiful tropical locations, with more than 50 harbors and dozens of diverse places to explore. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Become an adept skipper and progress across 6 different ship types. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Realistic weather conditions and 24hr day/night cycle. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Seek treasures in the deep, rescue people from drowning, avoid pirate attacks and become rich and famous! <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Use your earnings to build your commercial empire, buy and sell properties in this tropical paradise, progress from sun beds, beach houses and bungalows, to restaurants, villas and even hotels. <br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Play against 9 other NPC Skippers who compete for business against you, become the best skipper, earn more money and become the ultimate tycoon of the JoJo Islands!</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "The Good Life is an intriguing combination of gameplay styles: part tycoon, part time-management, part simulation and 100% fun! Live the life you always dreamed of on your way to becoming the area top dog in this tropical sandbox game.",
